{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>And draw near.</b> For judgment — my people, the house of Israel, says YHWH." "<b>Children of the sorceress.</b> Like ועוננים כפלשתים (Isaiah 2:6)." "<b>Seed of an adulterer.</b> This is the father." "<b>And she played the harlot.</b> The mother; and the meaning is that the sons and daughters are wicked."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 57, :notes {3 "Reading הטעם as 'the meaning'; possible the word is defective or an abbreviation."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:59:52.855788706Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}